{"ts":"2026-08-05T18:07:17.752Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"ac5e22eebf92a6af581282d9","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"1","source":"environment"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.222","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-yy8rmx"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Command-destination census: 14 of 76 canonical commands have no declared home in the target grammar, so the surface can be frozen with its shape still undecided"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["census","cli-grammar","consolidation","governance"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-05T18:07:17.752Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-05T18:07:17.752Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A checked-in destination table maps every canonical command emitted by pm contracts to exactly one of: a target noun, a named consolidation child, package-owned, or an explicit keep-as-is disposition with a reason; A gate fails when a command exists with no destination row, and fails when a destination row names a command the surface no longer emits; The census is recomputed from pm contracts at gate time, never hand-maintained; The 14 currently undeclared commands each carry a filed disposition before the grammar freeze in pm-agou can be declared complete"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","v